id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
31453::$$$message_0243_0000_0000$$$::It goes without saying that there's no one at the docks at this hour.[lr]::
31454::$$$message_0243_0000_0001$$$::That guy seems eccentric enough to enjoy night fishing, but he must've gone home for the night.::
31455::$$$message_0243_0001_0000$$$::"Oh, but I don't think Lancer would go back to the church.[lr]::
31456::$$$message_0243_0001_0001$$$::He must be camping in some abandoned building, or squatting in someone's empty house."[lr]::
31457::$$$message_0243_0001_0002$$$::...Hrm.[lr]::
31458::$$$message_0243_0001_0003$$$::For an instant, an image of a certain rarely used, fully furnished building springs to mind, open to illegal trespassing and squatting. It would be perfect for him.::
31459::$$$message_0243_0002_0000$$$::"Nah, even Lancer wouldn't go that far."[lr]::
31460::$$$message_0243_0002_0001$$$::There's no telling what sorts of traps might be in store, after all.[lr]::
31461::$$$message_0243_0002_0002$$$::He might actually be hanging out with the Fujimura Group, now that I think of it.::
31462::$$$message_0243_0003_0000$$$::"...But why does he stay away from the church?"[lr]::
31463::$$$message_0243_0003_0001$$$::I've noticed that even Goldy keeps his distance from the church.[lr]::
31464::$$$message_0243_0003_0002$$$::It's supposed to be empty at the moment.[lr]::
31465::$$$message_0243_0003_0003$$$::Don't tell me its supposedly deceased resident has returned.::
31466::$$$message_0243_0004_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
31467::$$$message_0243_0004_0001$$$::The sea breeze is chilly for October.[lr]::
31468::$$$message_0243_0004_0002$$$::I'll check out a different place before I catch a cold.::
931453::$$$message_9243_0000_0000$$$::It goes without saying that there's no one at the docks at this hour.[r]::
´